<title>USA: MedQuist Inc Q3 net shr $0.18 vs $0.24.</title>
<headline>MedQuist Inc Q3 net shr $0.18 vs $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>MARLTON, N.J. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>In thousands, except per share data</p>
<p>				     Three Months Ended September 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		 1995</p>
